1
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:06,120
Taming the Husband

2
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,840
Episode 18

3
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:15,680
<i>Such a beauty,</i>

4
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:18,960
<i>such a perfect day</i>

5
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,680
Where have you been
to come back in such a good mood?

6
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,280
I got some foreign wine,

7
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,200
from Reims, in France,

8
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,440
that Westerners love.

9
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:36,400
If only you could get us
a steady supply of that!

10
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,840
All these years,

11
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:41,080
that salt shop has made you a fortune,

12
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:43,800
but I've never seen you spend a penny!

13
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,040
Just one bottle of wine,
is that the best you can do?

14
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:49,680
Enough of that.
Come on, let's drink!

15
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,040
Here.

16
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:03,360
-Take this cup to Heng.
-Yes, sir.

17
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,520
Let him try it, too.

18
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,800
Come on.

19
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,320
It's hard to come by.

20
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,080
Here.

21
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,800
It is good.

22
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,600
-Good, isn't it?
-Very good.

23
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,040
As for the

24
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:33,680
salt permits
those small investors were holding,

25
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:37,280
guess someone was worried about ruining
the Xie salt shop's reputation,

26
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,680
so they went all out
and paid them all back.

27
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:43,400
That Zhou Wanjun
really is a good daughter-in-law.

28
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:47,760
I think for the family's sake,

29
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,200
she took on that whole mess,

30
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,000
and we really should drink to that.

31
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:54,560
I have some good news for you, too.

32
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,520
Jin Baozhu's stopped selling offal stew,

33
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,480
she's busy making pig pancreas soap now.

34
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,680
Pig pancreas?

35
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:06,480
Now that they've cleaned up the mess,

36
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,560
we need to get the shop back,

37
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,680
so it's time the old lady

38
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,720
was let in on the secret.

39
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:16,280
And, as it happens,

40
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:19,520
Xie Yan opened a new route today,

41
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:24,280
so I want the salt shop
and his cargo suppliers, too!

42
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,040
Look at you, showing off.

43
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,400
-This really is good.
-Something to savor slowly.

44
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,240
-Come on.
-What are you doing?

45
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,840
Such beauty!

46
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:47,880
<i>Such a beauty,</i>

47
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:53,400
<i>-such a perfect day.</i>
<i>-</i>Master, madam,

48
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,680
the matriarch summons you.

49
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,640
Letter of recommendation from the Xies
Guarantor: Zhan Dongfeng

50
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,920
Virtue brings blessings

51
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,840
What's happened

52
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,440
to bring you here, Grandmother?

53
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,400
If you wanted to keep it a secret,
you shouldn't have done it.

54
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:07,160
Lady Zhou
has been kneeling here for some time.

55
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,520
A clever boy like you

56
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,880
surely understands.

57
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:13,160
Do you still
refuse to admit your wrongdoing?

58
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,840
We've come here with no idea why,

59
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:17,000
and you tell us to admit wrongdoing,
but what wrongdoing?

60
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,840
Not long ago,
you were running the salt shop,

61
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:22,120
then handed it over to Lady Zhou.

62
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:25,160
Puzzled, I looked into it and found out

63
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,640
that you, Jin Baozhu,

64
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,720
had taken advantage of high salt prices

65
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,440
to sell more permits than allowed.

66
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,760
Then salt prices collapsed,

67
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,280
and customers demanded their money back,

68
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,960
but Lady Zhou and Yan

69
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,520
let you cover it up,

70
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,960
quietly settling the matter.

71
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,200
You deceived Mother

72
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,880
and the entire Xie family!

73
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,120
But we paid out of our own pockets

74
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,240
to refund every last coin,

75
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,840
and before any official investigation,

76
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:46,120
we bought back all the old salt permits.

77
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,680
If I've done anything wrong,

78
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,080
it's that

79
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,640
I've been so busy with grain transport,

80
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,800
opening a new route,

81
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,120
and securing several cargo suppliers,

82
00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:59,360
that I haven't yet had time to report it.

83
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,680
Please punish me, Grandmother.

84
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,720
Though I built my new shop from nothing,

85
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,720
bringing in quite a sum for the household,

86
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:10,120
I was so busy that I forgot to report it.

87
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,760
Please punish me, madam.

88
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:21,560
Get up off that cold floor

89
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,560
and sit down so we can talk.

90
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,280
-Thank you, Grandmother.
-Thank you, madam.

91
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,760
Virtue brings blessings

92
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:29,840
Mother.

93
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,560
Get up.

94
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,680
Wait.

95
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,760
This threatens the family's very survival,

96
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,840
yet you kept it to yourselves

97
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,120
and acted as you pleased,

98
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,800
so don't you owe us an explanation?

99
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:47,000
Besides, the authorities
may still investigate.

100
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:51,120
Yan, do the officials know?

101
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,680
Grandmother,

102
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,120
yes and no.

103
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,960
Either they do, or they don't!

104
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,200
What do you mean?

105
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:00,360
Overselling salt permits,

106
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,960
paying the refunds ourselves,

107
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,040
yes, we did that.

108
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,240
Colluding with officials

109
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,880
and endangering the entire family,

110
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,240
no,

111
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,600
that was you.

112
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,720
We ran that shop for eight or nine years

113
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,600
without a single problem,

114
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,280
until you came and trouble started,

115
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,280
and now you try to blame us?

116
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,480
Slandering your own family

117
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,080
is punishable under our family rules.

118
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,160
We know,

119
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,640
but apparently, you and Aunt Shen didn't,

120
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,320
or you wouldn't have done this

121
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:43,240
and then put on this performance.

122
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,120
Even the fairest magistrate

123
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:48,800
judging a case would need evidence.

124
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,920
With nothing but empty accusations,

125
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,640
how can you attack innocent people

126
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,120
like this?

127
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,640
What if we have proof?

128
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,160
Copy out a fake ledger

129
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,680
and have Heng sneak it back in.

130
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,560
Good idea.

131
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,240
Lu Xian will find out sooner or later,

132
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:17,360
so we can't tip off Uncle Rongchang,

133
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,160
otherwise we won't have
any cards left to play.

134
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,640
No. If Lu Xian notices anything,

135
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,240
he'll tell Uncle Rongchang at once.

136
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,840
We still got it wrong.

137
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,320
Lu Xian will be so eager to save himself

138
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,120
he may not care what happens
to Uncle Rongchang.

139
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,280
We didn't get it wrong.

140
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,200
Well done,

141
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,640
Jin Baozhu.

142
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:58,080
Feeling itchy, Uncle Rongchang?

143
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,640
Is this your proof?

144
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,320
Yes, it's the salt shop's ledger.

145
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:10,280
And what's wrong
with the salt shop's ledger?

146
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:12,480
Before Baozhu took over,

147
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,680
you and Aunt Shen spread rumors
that salt prices were going up,

148
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,960
then raised prices and sold out.

149
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,400
To cover your tracks,

150
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,400
you took away the shop's ledger

151
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,280
and gave her a fake one.

152
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,040
Then you bought up
large numbers of old salt permits,

153
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,960
altered their numbers to pass them as new,

154
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,600
and waited for Baozhu to take the bait,

155
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:32,200
so she'd take the blame for overselling.

156
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,280
Wait.

157
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,520
If that's true,

158
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:38,040
how could Baozhu not notice
the permits were old?

159
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,960
I'd never seen a genuine salt permit,

160
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,440
since from the very start
all I ever saw were old permits,

161
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,600
so how could I tell the difference?

162
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,040
The assistants who could

163
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,320
were already working for Uncle Rongchang.

164
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:48,160
Uncle Rongchang says
salt prices are going up,

165
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,400
and everyone just believes him?

166
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,760
He'd have made a fortune long ago,

167
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,000
so why wait until now?

168
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,360
Because he colluded with officials.

169
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,440
Nonsense!

170
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,080
I say your ledger is the fake,

171
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,440
perhaps just something to scare us with.

172
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:02,120
Fine. How would you tell

173
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,200
whether a ledger is genuine?

174
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:05,040
If it's genuine,

175
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:08,640
each day's entries must bear
my seal and my wife's.

176
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,040
Have a look

177
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,560
and see if there are any seals.

178
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,400
Look, everyone, there are no seals at all,

179
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,720
so this is clearly a fake ledger!

180
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,240
Salt Sales and Freight

181
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,960
No, wait.

182
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,480
Father, have some soup to sober you up

183
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,640
while it's still hot.

184
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,400
Even if there are seals,

185
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:14,280
couldn't they be forged?

186
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:17,520
Go and bring it here for me to see.

187
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,320
These seals are genuine.

188
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,560
What's going on?

189
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:39,360
If the seals aren't forged,

190
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:44,520
perhaps someone stole them from somewhere.

191
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,240
Lady Qin,

192
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:49,040
where do you keep your seal?

193
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,040
On me.

194
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,920
-Why?
-Why?

195
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,360
So I don't lose it!

196
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:08,840
With so many people coming and going,

197
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,480
I wouldn't dare leave it anywhere!

198
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,520
As you can all see,

199
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,280
Lady Qin and I

200
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,440
rarely see eye to eye,

201
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:19,000
so she would never play along with me.

202
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,760
If even someone as careless as Lady Qin,

203
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,200
who doctored the plum drinks

204
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,320
and rigged that favorable cast,

205
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:26,480
can keep her seal safe,

206
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,040
then surely Aunt Shen

207
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,120
and Uncle Rongchang can, too.

208
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,320
Why drag other people into it?

209
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:34,760
If you can't prove your own innocence,

210
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,000
why should we accept the blame?

211
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,840
Grandmother,

212
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,880
may I look at the ledger?

213
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:56,920
Salt Ledger

214
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,440
Salt Ledger

215
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:03,760
This ledger

216
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:06,480
smells of Jade Dew powder.

217
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:10,200
What an unusual fragrance.

218
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:13,040
The finest white jasmine.

219
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:18,000
It uses the finest white jasmine,

220
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,440
pearl powder, and ambergris,

221
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,080
finely ground

222
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,640
and passed through three silk sieves

223
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,720
to yield just five or six boxes.

224
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,520
I even use it myself.

225
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,000
This white jasmine scent,

226
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,280
I think I've smelled it somewhere before.

227
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,600
This perfumed powder is made from flowers.

228
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:44,640
Aunt Shen's shop
is full of fine goods like that.

229
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,840
So what?

230
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,160
Perhaps you
sent someone to buy some from my shop

231
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:49,760
-to fake this ledger!
-Enough!

232
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:55,400
Mother!

233
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:57,040
Mother!

234
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,200
I admit it!

235
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,720
I admit it, Mother!

236
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,760
I admit it! I admit it!

237
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,200
And the bandit ambush?

238
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,320
I admit it! I admit it!

239
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:11,600
I put the Huangs in touch
with those hired thugs.

240
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,480
And borrowing our sounding crew?

241
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,560
I admit that, too!

242
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,760
I deliberately sent them away

243
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,800
to leave you helpless. I…

244
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:19,880
You disgrace!

245
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,360
As a commoner,

246
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,640
how could you manipulate salt prices?

247
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:28,720
How did you get hold of
all those old salt permits?

248
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:33,320
And all that money, where did it go?

249
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:35,920
Speak!

250
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,320
She…

251
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:48,120
Be ready and bide your time
Peace and plenty for a new year

252
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:52,680
A storm is coming.

253
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,000
Mother!

254
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:01,680
she's the one who talked me
into giving her all the money!

255
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:04,160
It wasn't me!
Madam, don't listen to his nonsense!

256
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,240
It was her!

257
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,040
Xie Rongchang, you bastard!

258
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,280
How dare you treat me like this?

259
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,360
I'm not lying!

260
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,600
All the money's…

261
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:13,320
all the money's in your hands!

262
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:15,560
-Mother!
-Madam! It was all his doing,

263
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,120
pushing up the price of salt!

264
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,600
Mother, all the money's with her!

265
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:20,920
She bewitched me!

266
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,760
I just lost my head for a second, I--

267
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:23,880
Servants!

268
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,520
Tie her up

269
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:27,720
and hand her over to the authorities!

270
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:33,320
You vicious woman! Vicious woman!

271
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,000
Master Song!

272
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,080
-You can't go in!
-Madam!

273
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,240
Madam!

274
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:38,960
I have something to say.

275
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:42,080
Whatever it is, leave it for another day.

276
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:43,680
We're done here.

277
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,840
Madam!

278
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,320
The salt shop affair

279
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:49,920
had nothing to do with Madam Shen!

280
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:54,120
You're an outsider,
so this doesn't concern you.

281
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:55,920
Matron Fang!

282
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,200
What are you waiting for?

283
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,880
Get him out of here!

284
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,200
Please stay, madam!

285
00:16:00,280 --> 00:16:01,400
Please stay!

286
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:03,840
Madam, for the sake
of all the years Madam Shen

287
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:05,840
has worked tirelessly for the family

288
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,760
and for mine, after all the years

289
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:08,920
I've treated everyone
in the Xie household,

290
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,320
please trust me this once.

291
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:13,680
I'll vouch for Madam Shen,
staking my future on it.

292
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:16,720
You ungrateful wretch!
You ungrateful wretch!

293
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:18,520
All those years raising you, for nothing!

294
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:21,120
You… Mother,

295
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:23,080
he's siding with Shen Manyun
because he has

296
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:24,680
a letter of recommendation from the Xies.

297
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:25,920
You refused to give him one,

298
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,880
so Shen Manyun
stole your seal and stamped it herself!

299
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,040
You…

300
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,440
You're guilty, too!

301
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,600
Since you said "too",

302
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:35,960
does that mean
you admit everything I said is true?

303
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:38,480
-You…
-The salt prices, the permits, the money,

304
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:39,760
where did it all come from,

305
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:40,840
and where did it go?

306
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:42,520
How could I…

307
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:48,040
Lord Lu!

308
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:53,120
-Lord Lu!
-I'd like to know that myself.

309
00:16:58,840 --> 00:16:59,840
No hurry,

310
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:02,640
after all that meat,

311
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:05,560
I'm feeling rather bloated.

312
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,920
Then throw the meat away,

313
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:10,840
but do wipe the grease

314
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,720
off your mouth first.

315
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:15,280
You're right, my lord.

316
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:18,200
Since someone's seen the ledger,

317
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,120
we'll be exposed sooner or later,

318
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:23,760
so we'd better find a scapegoat first,

319
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:26,320
and the wealthy Xies

320
00:17:26,760 --> 00:17:28,880
are ripe for slaughter.

321
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,640
Lord Lu,

322
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,880
what is going on?

323
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:36,120
My investigation has established

324
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:39,160
that Xie Rongchang
manipulated salt prices,

325
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,960
oversold salt permits,

326
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:42,720
violated the court's salt laws,

327
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:45,560
and embezzled public funds.

328
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,400
He must be taken into custody at once

329
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:50,560
for a thorough interrogation and inquiry.

330
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,800
-Guards!
-Here!

331
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,880
-Take him away!
-Yes, sir!

332
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:00,560
Save me, my lord! My lord!

333
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:02,680
Heng can't have a criminal for a father!

334
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,680
My lord, save me!

335
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:07,240
Then why don't you just die?

336
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,960
When a secret's bound to blow up,

337
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:12,400
you obviously need someone
to take the fall.

338
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,840
Blame yourself,

339
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:16,520
you clueless, useless excuse for a father!

340
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:18,520
-My lord, you…
-Take him away!

341
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:19,600
Move!

342
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,560
Heng, look after the family!

343
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,680
You may be ashamed of me,

344
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,040
but I'm proud of you!

345
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,280
I'm proud of you!

346
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,360
Stop!

347
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:28,960
Lu Xian,

348
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,520
you colluded with merchants,

349
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:31,720
preyed on the people,

350
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:33,040
and embezzled a fortune!

351
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:49,400
What else do you know?

352
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,800
I stole my father's ledger!

353
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,400
-No!
-So I know!

354
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:55,640
I know you took bribes,

355
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,440
I know the news about salt prices

356
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,920
came from your office,

357
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,520
and those old salt permits
were sold off by you!

358
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:04,680
I also know you used the sounding crew

359
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:06,040
to force my father

360
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:07,840
to squeeze money from the people for you,

361
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,800
every last coin

362
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,800
going into your pockets, Lu Xian!

363
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:14,880
No wonder

364
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:17,400
you're your father's favorite.

365
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:26,680
But so what?

366
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:28,960
Where's your proof?

367
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,680
I have proof!

368
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:39,880
For knowingly slandering a court official,

369
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:42,200
under our laws,

370
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:47,320
your entire family
will be held accountable.

371
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,600
Where is your proof?

372
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:53,600
In here.

373
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:55,760
In here?

374
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:58,400
Just based on what's in here?

375
00:19:58,480 --> 00:19:59,640
Yes.

376
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:01,800
Lord Lu,

377
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,640
have you forgotten

378
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:06,680
how we came to collect that debt?

379
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,920
My husband recited every word

380
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,640
of the torn-out ledger pages from memory.

381
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:14,920
I've written it all out,

382
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:18,200
and if you dare lay a hand on our family,
hundreds, thousands,

383
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:21,120
even tens of thousands of copies
will appear all over Yangzhou.

384
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:23,800
Impossible!

385
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:26,520
You're welcome to take that chance.

386
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:43,680
Then I won't arrest

387
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:46,240
this relative of yours for now,

388
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:48,200
and I'll make that deal with you.

389
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,000
"Open waterways, enrich the nation."

390
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:51,600
"Pass down kindness and integrity."

391
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:53,480
To save yourselves,

392
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:55,200
even the Xies know when to bend.

393
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:56,760
When did I say I'd protect him?

394
00:20:57,800 --> 00:20:58,840
What do you mean?

395
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:02,440
I simply can't stand by
and watch innocent people suffer.

396
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,640
Uncle Rongchang helped you
prey on others,

397
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:04,840
so he deserves to be punished,

398
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,000
he doesn't deserve to die.

399
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:09,320
You do, Lu Xian!

400
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,760
Lord Lu!

401
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:15,080
What if I, Lu Xian,

402
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,800
Lord Lu himself, told you

403
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:19,680
that not one coin

404
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:21,800
went into my pocket?

405
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,240
At collection, they extort grain
for supposed wastage

406
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:25,360
or silver in place of grain.

407
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:27,760
At transshipment, officers take a cut,

408
00:21:27,840 --> 00:21:29,280
while the transport troops
buy and resell grain.

409
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:31,320
Every lock demands a toll,

410
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:34,320
and rapids and spring wardens charge fees.

411
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:36,520
Then come ship taxes,
cargo levies, gate charges,

412
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:38,600
warehouse screening and drying fees,

413
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:40,640
storage fees, floor-lining fees,

414
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:42,120
bribes for entry, bribes for inspections,

415
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:43,560
and bribes for the storekeepers!

416
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:45,240
Ours is a vast nation,

417
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:47,520
crisscrossed with rivers and waterways,

418
00:21:47,600 --> 00:21:52,800
but the cargo the Xies transport
is just the tip of the iceberg.

419
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:57,200
Have you ever seen
all those layers of extortion?

420
00:21:57,320 --> 00:22:00,160
If I hadn't colluded with merchants,

421
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:03,120
if I hadn't embezzled a fortune,

422
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:07,000
if I hadn't
taken the people's hard-earned money

423
00:22:07,080 --> 00:22:08,400
and paid off my superiors,

424
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:11,400
Yangzhou's grain transport and its people

425
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:13,000
would be a hundred times worse off,

426
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:14,360
a thousand, ten thousand times worse!

427
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,880
Go on, then,

428
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:25,680
have me arrested.

429
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:29,000
Lord Lu,

430
00:22:29,800 --> 00:22:33,880
may I ask who your superior is?

431
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:38,720
The Minister of Revenue,

432
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:40,320
Ye Xianggao,

433
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:47,320
your own grandfather, Xie Yan.

434
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:53,680
You old scoundrel!

435
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:18,040
A gift from Hanzhang

436
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:31,520
Mother!

437
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,680
Mother!

438
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,560
I don't understand why, back when

439
00:23:37,640 --> 00:23:40,760
Yan was injured,
Minister Ye never came to visit.

440
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:49,760
His daughter died in the Xie household.

441
00:23:50,960 --> 00:23:53,720
But dying in childbirth
wasn't the Xies' fault.

442
00:23:54,760 --> 00:23:55,760
She died a violent death.

443
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:57,280
What?

444
00:24:00,080 --> 00:24:03,280
But didn't everyone say...

445
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:06,560
She died in childbirth?

446
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:08,280
I must be remembering wrong.

447
00:24:11,360 --> 00:24:13,840
So the salt shop affair just ends here?

448
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:18,360
Stripped of his private assets

449
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:20,000
and expelled from the clan,

450
00:24:20,320 --> 00:24:21,320
your Uncle Rongchang

451
00:24:22,520 --> 00:24:24,520
was exiled to the frontier
to work in grain transport,

452
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:26,640
where whatever he earns

453
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,640
will go to the local people.

454
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:31,840
Aunt Shen is confined to the inner court,

455
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:35,440
never to leave the Xie residence again.

456
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,920
What about Lu Xian and Minister Ye?

457
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:45,600
Heaven will deal with the wicked.

458
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:54,360
This came from my family, not the Xies!

459
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:56,240
Give it back! Give it back!

460
00:25:00,800 --> 00:25:01,800
All of this

461
00:25:02,080 --> 00:25:04,600
is thanks to that precious son of yours!

462
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:06,520
I won't let him get away with it,

463
00:25:06,600 --> 00:25:07,920
not even in death!

464
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,200
I'm warning you,

465
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,920
If you touch Heng,

466
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:15,520
I'll strangle you!

467
00:25:16,200 --> 00:25:17,520
You wouldn't dare!

468
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:20,720
I'll strangle you right now!

469
00:25:27,840 --> 00:25:31,640
My greatest regret
is marrying into this family!

470
00:25:32,320 --> 00:25:35,800
Go and die out there and never come back!

471
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:40,120
I will never come back here again!

472
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,160
Xie Rongchang!

473
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:45,440
Xie Rongchang! Come back here!

474
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,640
Xie Rongchang!

475
00:25:47,360 --> 00:25:49,600
Xie Rongchang, come back!

476
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,400
Jingxing.

477
00:26:13,520 --> 00:26:14,880
There, it's in place.

478
00:26:16,840 --> 00:26:19,960
You won't leave me, will you?

479
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:22,360
The letter is void,

480
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:24,560
and the matriarch will let the past go.

481
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:27,360
What reason do I have to stay here now?

482
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,480
What about me?

483
00:26:33,760 --> 00:26:34,760
Jingxing,

484
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:37,360
I'm your mother.

485
00:26:39,120 --> 00:26:40,720
You were lonely,

486
00:26:40,800 --> 00:26:43,880
and on a whim,
you picked me to play a part.

487
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:46,080
No! That's not true!

488
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:48,400
You're my only son!

489
00:26:49,080 --> 00:26:51,760
We've depended on each other
in this cage for ten years,

490
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:56,040
and even when you betrayed me and lied,

491
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:59,760
I still understood and forgave you,

492
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:02,160
because you promised

493
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:05,880
you wouldn't leave me alone
to grow old and die here!

494
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:07,520
You promised

495
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:10,080
you'd return in glory and take me away.

496
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:12,560
The freedom the Xies denied me,

497
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:14,080
you'd give me, wouldn't you?

498
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,600
Do you remember?

499
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:17,040
Do you remember?

500
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:18,480
Do you remember?

501
00:27:19,280 --> 00:27:21,520
Jingxing, I'm begging you,

502
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:22,800
please don't leave me.

503
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:24,120
I'm begging you!

504
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:28,120
Please, I'm begging you!

505
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:34,240
This play has run for far too long.

506
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:38,040
Jingxing!

507
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:42,240
Madam Shen,

508
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:45,720
it's time the curtain fell.

509
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,320
You promised

510
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:05,360
you wouldn't leave me to die here.

511
00:28:05,440 --> 00:28:07,080
Have you forgotten?

512
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:23,600
The Xie Ancestral Hall

513
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:26,560
I ask our ancestors to bear witness

514
00:28:27,080 --> 00:28:28,520
that Xie Yan, your legitimate grandson,

515
00:28:28,760 --> 00:28:30,320
and his concubine, Jin Baozhu,

516
00:28:30,560 --> 00:28:31,920
have managed their household well

517
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:34,360
and earned a higher family rank.

518
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:36,120
We dare not decide alone,

519
00:28:36,560 --> 00:28:39,960
so we respectfully ask our ancestors
for approval.

520
00:29:11,320 --> 00:29:12,560
This is yours.

521
00:29:18,120 --> 00:29:19,600
This is yours.

522
00:29:20,560 --> 00:29:21,560
Grandmother…

523
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:25,160
Baozhu, you deserve it.

524
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,240
Come here.

525
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,720
-Happy?
-Very.

526
00:29:53,320 --> 00:29:54,360
-Greetings, Lady Lin.
-Greetings, Lady Lin.

527
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:58,680
I saw your lights were still on,
so I thought I'd stop by.

528
00:29:58,760 --> 00:30:02,480
I found this
while tidying up the other day,

529
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:06,960
and thought you might like it, Baozhu,

530
00:30:07,120 --> 00:30:08,520
so I brought it along.

531
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:10,800
Anything of yours, Lady Lin,

532
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:12,000
is far too precious

533
00:30:12,080 --> 00:30:13,600
and would be wasted on me.

534
00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:19,680
A hand cannon.

535
00:30:21,400 --> 00:30:23,680
Baozhu, is it to your liking?

536
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:29,600
I love it.

537
00:30:31,720 --> 00:30:32,720
Jiang He,

538
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:34,960
take Lady Jin to try it out.

539
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:37,280
Lady Jin, this way, please.

540
00:30:37,360 --> 00:30:38,360
Go on.

541
00:30:49,280 --> 00:30:51,000
I came especially to thank you.

542
00:30:51,600 --> 00:30:53,840
I gave the orders on the boat,

543
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:56,200
and I'm grateful

544
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:57,920
you kept that from the family,
young master.

545
00:30:59,520 --> 00:31:00,760
If you'd like to thank me,

546
00:31:01,120 --> 00:31:02,600
could you make me a promise?

547
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:05,240
I'll do what I can.

548
00:31:06,800 --> 00:31:09,120
Tall trees catch the fiercest winds,

549
00:31:09,680 --> 00:31:11,000
so when I'm away,

550
00:31:11,360 --> 00:31:14,000
could you look out for Baozhu?

551
00:31:16,560 --> 00:31:18,320
